Subject: [PATCH 2/3] fix(runner): keep heartbeat responsive during project
 scans

Run project inventory scans outside the socket loop. Coalesce refreshes, retain one physical worker across reconnects, and fence late results by owning session and revision. Preserve original independent Jobs.

Prior source validation: 109 transport tests including 6 blocking-scan tests; formatted source will be bound to the clean build and isolated process verification.

